  key: firstArtifact
  charName: Art, the Creativity Spren
  dialogue:
  - Would you look at that! It seems like you just uncovered an artifact! These masterworks
    are granted by the benefactor whenever you meet specific milestones in your curation
    journey.
  - These artifacts can also be placed onto pillars present in your museum - visitors
    will donate more the more impressive the work was to achieve.
  - Go check out the Artifact Archives and check out your new work! If you like what
    you see, go ahead and display it for a boost to donations!
  outlineTag: artifacts
